  "title": "Mou Shu Pork Wraps",
  "description": "Onions, fresh ginger, and garlic are stir-fried with strips of lean pork loin, bok choy, and mushrooms to produce a flavorful filling for tortilla wraps.",
  "authors": [
    "RUDEDUDE"
  ],
